                <pb facs="0654" n="566" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg566"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 438.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Stamford Manufacturing Company to Mr.
                    Hirsch.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Alexandretta, Syria</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Confirm telegram 6th, letter 11th. Case very urgent.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stamford.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
